                                &lt;h2&gt;1.3.0-beta.1 (2025-11-12)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Features Added&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Upgraded api-version tag from 'package-2025-05' to 'package-preview-2025-10'&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adds new managedDomainList property in DnsSecurityRule to allow users to use managed domain lists such as AzureDnsThreatIntel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Other Changes&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Domain list is no longer required for a DNS Security rule if managed domain list is being used.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
